{ lsq_string.init - a DSEE derived object of be_com/backend.ins.pas
  (cc.a88k only): the names of the load and store qualifiers (lsq$t), 4 of 8
  characters.
  Included by dmp.pas after its other inserts.

  No Apollo copy survives; reconstructed from the DOMAIN C 6.9 binary
  cc.a88k: dmp's data +0x260 (32 bytes, set by .rwdi).

  Not known from the original: the declaration's form (its name is the
  file's). }

var
  lsq_string: array [lsq$t] of packed array [1..8] of char := [
    'normal  ',
    'lock    ',
    'unlock  ',
    'physical'];
